{"title":"Bandit Tunic","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Highwayman, Bandit Footpad, Reaver, Sellsword</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"footpad\" title=\"Bandit Footpad - dropped it in 1 of 8 looted corpses (1/8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/1eae4e803907596d0d60.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Footpad</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"highwayman\" title=\"Highwayman - dropped it in 2 of 30 looted corpses (1/15)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/01bd8b56b2a034105292.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Highwayman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"reaver\" title=\"Reaver - dropped it in 1 of 17 looted corpses (1/17)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/e4f2bddfb547f2d8fdf7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Reaver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sellsword\" title=\"Sellsword - dropped it in 1 of 38 looted corpses (1/38)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/afa1d7f81a70bebcbcb2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sellsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/38<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"bandit-tunic\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/d7826cf6366831b7b094.svg\" alt=\"Bandit Tunic\"></div><h3>Bandit Tunic</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/14/2026, 8:51:17 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}